The initial server walking skeleton is an original implementation using the Go
standard library. Later model, store, authentication, session, and API files
substantially adapt eligible Mattermost source. Those files preserve the
Mattermost copyright notice, identify their upstream source in-file, and are
recorded below.

The cohesive configuration, platform, server, application, and test-helper flow
was behaviorally compared with Mattermost revision
10b780cb097b2ec94ab0f9df7ebcbd5b7850f13f, particularly:

- server/config/store.go;
- server/channels/app/server.go;
- server/channels/app/platform/service.go;
- server/channels/app/platform/config.go;
- server/channels/app/platform/log.go;
- server/channels/app/helper_test.go;
- server/channels/testlib/helper.go;
- server/public/shared/mlog.

Proctor's corresponding walking-skeleton implementation was independently
written and does not copy those Mattermost sources.

