- retained Mattermost's root store and per-model store composition:
  `store.Store`, model-store interfaces, `SqlStoreStores`, concrete
  `Sql<Model>Store` implementations, and interface-returning accessors;
- retained explicit PostgreSQL pool lifecycle, centralized SQL execution
